<title>ESTONIA: UHIS TO SIGN CITY BUDGET AGREEMENT.</title>
<headline>UHIS TO SIGN CITY BUDGET AGREEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank and Tallinn city government will formally sign an agreement on Tuesday under which the bank will hold the city's budget funds, the bank on Monday.</p>
<p>The third largest bank in Estonia, Uhispank won the competition to hold the city budget in March.</p>
<p>The bank is also one of the main holders of state government budget funds.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6308 400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
